// flesh-pit loop patch. bpm 60: trigger(n) fires n per second. Loop length is set in sounds.json; every rate here divides it.
// id: chew_strain -- eating past full: laboured breathing through the nose and a throat that does not want more. 4 s loop, one breath per 2 s.
breath_am = (sine(0.5) + 1) * 0.5
breath = noise(0, 0, 401) * breath_am * 0.5 |> bp(@, 1500, 1.3)
fry = noise(0, 0, 419) * gt(noise(25, 0, 421), 0.30) * (1 - breath_am * 0.5) * 0.12 |> bp(@, 520, 3.5)
groan_tone = tri(140 + sine(0.25) * 5) * (1 - breath_am * 0.6) * 0.12 |> bp(@, 620, 4.0)
groan = groan_tone * 0.4 + fry
out((breath + groan) * 0.05)
